        {
          "text": "Yeova nĩwetie syĩtwa yaku, Mũthata mwĩũ, wa kwendeesya wĩ na ũsyao mũseo: nũkwatĩtye mwaki ĩũlũ waw’o na kĩlonzo kya kĩtuu kĩnene, na mbonge syaw’o nĩ ndũlĩku. ",
