          "text": "Kwondũ wa ũu Yeova eneena ũndũ wa ana ma Anathothi, ala mamanthaa thayũ waku, makyasya, Ndũkathane syĩtwanĩ ya Yeova, ndũkoawe nĩ moko maitũ; ",
